OL,3,GNEWSAAudit into the governance of
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland Water
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Infrastructure Minister Liz Kimmins
OL,7,Fhas launched an audit into the
OL,8,Fgovernance of NI Water.
OL,10,FIn a written statement, the minister
OL,11,Fsaid there are a number of ongoing
OL,12,Fissues, some of which have been subject
OL,13,Fto investigation and have already
OL,14,Fresulted in the need for action plans.
OL,16,FKimmins did not outline the ongoing
OL,17,Fissues in her announcement.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
