OL,3,GNEWSAAudit into the governance of
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland Water
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever she said cited the "scale,
OL,7,Fvolume and severity of these concerns"
OL,8,Fcombined with the "time it has taken NI
OL,9,FWater to conduct the required
OL,10,Finvestigations" in her decision to
OL,11,Flaunch the investigation.
